      "section": "论起息法",
      "text": "渊海子平卷一",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c021:p0001",
      "sha256": "a5b823f6ea5176cb26de398b4c34c75d5a8a162220ac6a0c9e33ec836fae8376"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起息法",
      "text": "论起息法",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c021:p0002",
      "sha256": "738af59957742aaafd0a4385cb65e28fb04531fbc77351852f6e072a768217c6"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起息法",
      "text": "取日主上天干合处，地支合处是也。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c021:p0003",
      "sha256": "cadcb63bb8553bedb848c9d0e3bc55a5bad8c77cf2aee59a77b297cc0aaa002c"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起息法",
      "text": "假如甲子日生人，天干年月时有己字，乃甲与己合。又取地支年月时有丑字，即己丑也。余皆仿此而推，此胎息之由。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c021:p0004",
      "sha256": "ec6e3a937b2290524a25bc6aa955737f9faba55e991ccda9ff31d09b4ffe9ccc"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起息法",
      "text": "眉批：如推贵命先从胎息之吉日，相生扶者贵，相克者贫",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
